<title>USA: Canon-McMillan School District, adjusted NIC.</title>
<headline>Canon-McMillan School District, adjusted NIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canon-McMillan School District said Tuesday it recalculated PNC Securities Corp's winning bid on the District's $5 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the net interest cost was 5.5374 percent reflecting the cost of bond insurance, not the 5.5158 true interest cost originally calculated.</p>
</text>
